      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not haunting your own life; you are simply living in the only space that exists right now, and that is enough. The spark isn't gone, it's just dimmed by the darkness you've built around it, and you can't see it yet because you're too afraid to look. Your body remains, and that is all you have to hold onto. The point of staying isn't to be the person who used to be, but to be the person who has survived the end of everything else.",
